{"seq":3,"slug":"kyb-risk-tier-approval","title":"KYB 风险分级与入驻审批/补件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/business-account-qualification/kyb-risk-tier-approval","wordCount":2322,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"kyb-风险分级与入驻审批-补件\">KYB 风险分级与入驻审批/补件</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前面所有篇章都在生产<strong>判定信号</strong>：主体是否真实、经营范围是否覆盖、地址是否可信、UBO 是谁、挂名风险多高、账户是否属于主体、资质是否齐备。本篇是这些信号的收口——把它们合成一个<strong>可执行的审批决策</strong>，并管理&quot;证据不足&quot;这个最常见状态的处理路径。</p>\n<p>收口环节最容易犯的错误，是把所有信号塞进一个加权分数然后卡阈值。这个做法的失败模式是可预测的：一个制裁命中被地址一致性和资质完备的高分稀释掉，最终总分仍然&quot;及格&quot;。风控系统里有些信号是<strong>不可交易</strong>的，它们不是分数的组成部分，而是分数的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[全部判定信号] --&gt; B{硬否决项检查}&#10;  B --&gt;|命中| Z[拒绝 / 上报]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C[加权风险分]&#10;  C --&gt; D{分数分档}&#10;  D --&gt;|低| E[自动通过]&#10;  D --&gt;|中| F[自动补件 / 人工复核]&#10;  D --&gt;|高| G[增强尽调 EDD]&#10;  F --&gt; H{补件结果}&#10;  H --&gt;|齐备| C&#10;  H --&gt;|超时| I[自动拒绝]&#10;  H --&gt;|仍不足| G&#10;  G --&gt; J[人工终审]&#10;  E --&gt; K[写入审批档案]&#10;  Z --&gt; K&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[全部判定信号] --&gt; B{硬否决项检查}\n  B --&gt;|命中| Z[拒绝 / 上报]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C[加权风险分]\n  C --&gt; D{分数分档}\n  D --&gt;|低| E[自动通过]\n  D --&gt;|中| F[自动补件 / 人工复核]\n  D --&gt;|高| G[增强尽调 EDD]\n  F --&gt; H{补件结果}\n  H --&gt;|齐备| C\n  H --&gt;|超时| I[自动拒绝]\n  H --&gt;|仍不足| G\n  G --&gt; J[人工终审]\n  E --&gt; K[写入审批档案]\n  Z --&gt; K\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"否决项与加权项的分离\">否决项与加权项的分离</h2><h3 id=\"什么是硬否决项\">什么是硬否决项</h3><p>硬否决项满足两个条件：<strong>违反即不可补救</strong>（或在合理期限内不可补救），且<strong>不因其他维度的优秀而减轻</strong>。在当前设计的 KYB 链路里，硬否决项至少包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>否决项</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>不可补救的原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>制裁确认命中</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ubo-controller-due-diligence/ubo-sanctions-aml-interface\">UBO 与制裁/AML 筛查接口</a></td>\n<td>法定禁止，无商业理由可豁免</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体不存在或已除名</td>\n<td>登记事实快照</td>\n<td>合同主体缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执照/关键资质吊销</td>\n<td><a href=\"industry-license-precondition\">行业资质与前置经营许可</a></td>\n<td>经营行为本身违法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账户不属于主体且无合法解释</td>\n<td><a href=\"corporate-bank-account-ownership\">对公银行账户归属验证</a></td>\n<td>资金去向不可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制资质缺失</td>\n<td>资质要求表</td>\n<td>无资质经营违法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>筛查未完成或疑似未复核</td>\n<td>筛查门禁条件</td>\n<td>结论不完整即不可批准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意最后一条容易被漏掉：<strong>&quot;还没查完&quot;必须等价于&quot;不能批准&quot;</strong>。把它当作&quot;暂无风险&quot;处理，会产生一类系统性漏洞——攻击者只需让某个环节的筛查长期停留在 pending，就能让这笔审批在事实上绕过筛查。</p>\n<h3 id=\"加权项的构成\">加权项的构成</h3><p>硬否决之外的信号进入加权，权重按&quot;该信号对欺诈的区分度&quot;设定，而不是按获取难度或主观重要性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;score_model&quot;: &quot;kyb_risk_v3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;weights&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;identity_assurance&quot;: 0.18,&#10;    &quot;nominee_risk_inverse&quot;: 0.16,&#10;    &quot;ubo_resolution_confidence&quot;: 0.14,&#10;    &quot;address_consistency&quot;: 0.12,&#10;    &quot;scope_coverage&quot;: 0.1,&#10;    &quot;credential_completeness&quot;: 0.12,&#10;    &quot;account_ownership&quot;: 0.18&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;bands&quot;: { &quot;low&quot;: [0, 0.3], &quot;medium&quot;: [0.3, 0.62], &quot;high&quot;: [0.62, 1.0] }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"score_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kyb_risk_v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"weights\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"identity_assurance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"nominee_risk_inverse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ubo_resolution_confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"address_consistency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"scope_coverage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"credential_completeness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"account_ownership\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.18</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bands\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.62</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.62</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>权重必须<strong>版本化</strong>（<code>score_model</code>），因为权重调整是常态，而历史决策必须可复现。这与此前各篇对 <code>mapping_version</code>、<code>engine_version</code>、<code>list_versions</code> 的要求是同一个原则：<strong>任何影响判定的配置都要能被钉住。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么分档而不是二值\">为什么分档而不是二值</h3><p>三档（低/中/高）而不是二值（通过/拒绝）的理由是<strong>成本</strong>：一次人工复核有真实成本，把全部商家都送去人工会让系统失去意义；而全部自动通过则意味着放弃控制。中档存在的价值就是让&quot;证据不足但无明显风险&quot;这类占据多数的情形有一条自动化的补件通道，而不是占用人工。</p>\n<p>分档也对应着尽调强度的分野。增强尽调（EDD）的做法在反洗钱标准里有明确的来源：对更高风险业务关系的额外检查与监测要求见于 FATF 2003 年的《四十项建议》，其内涵是在完成身份核验后，若识别出高风险因素，则执行&quot;高于常规 CDD 的增强或额外尽调&quot;，包括资金来源与财富来源核查以及额外的身份调查；同时，<strong>持续监测被描述为一项强制义务</strong>，是 CDD 项目的核心要素之一，要求在整个业务关系期间进行交易监测与可疑交易报告，而 EDD 关系应受到&quot;更进一步的、更高强度的持续监测&quot;（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Know_your_customer\">Know your customer</a>）。</p>\n<p>这解释了一个常见的设计错误：把 EDD 实现为&quot;一次性更严格的审核&quot;。按上述标准，EDD 的实质是<strong>更高的核验强度 + 更高的监测频率</strong>，两者缺一，EDD 就退化成了&quot;让商家多传几份材料的繁琐流程&quot;。</p>\n<p>档位边界的具体位置应当按<strong>误拒成本与漏放成本的比值</strong>来确定，而不是拍脑袋。这个过程依赖 <a href=\"../kyb-monitoring-lifecycle/kyb-coverage-falsepositive-metric\">KYB 覆盖率/误拒/时效度量</a> 提供的实测数据，因此分档阈值调优是数据驱动的迭代，不是一次性设定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补件流程的状态机\">补件流程的状态机</h2><h3 id=\"状态与迁移\">状态与迁移</h3><p>补件不是&quot;发一封邮件要求补充材料&quot;，而是一个有超时、可多次往返、需要幂等处理的状态机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"REQUEST_STATES = {&#10;    &quot;created&quot;:    {&quot;send&quot;: &quot;awaiting_merchant&quot;},&#10;    &quot;awaiting_merchant&quot;: {&quot;submit&quot;: &quot;under_review&quot;, &quot;timeout&quot;: &quot;expired&quot;},&#10;    &quot;under_review&quot;: {&quot;accept&quot;: &quot;resolved&quot;, &quot;reject&quot;: &quot;awaiting_merchant&quot;,&#10;                     &quot;escalate&quot;: &quot;escalated&quot;},&#10;    &quot;escalated&quot;:  {&quot;decide_approve&quot;: &quot;resolved&quot;, &quot;decide_reject&quot;: &quot;closed_rejected&quot;},&#10;    &quot;expired&quot;:    {&quot;reopen&quot;: &quot;awaiting_merchant&quot;},   # 需人工批准&#10;    &quot;resolved&quot;:   {}, &quot;closed_rejected&quot;: {},&#10;}&#10;&#10;MAX_ROUNDS = 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUEST_STATES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"send\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"awaiting_merchant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"awaiting_merchant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"under_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"expired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"under_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"resolved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reject\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"awaiting_merchant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                     \"escalate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"escalated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"escalated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"decide_approve\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"resolved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"decide_reject\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"closed_rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"expired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reopen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"awaiting_merchant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 需人工批准</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"resolved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:   {}, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"closed_rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MAX_ROUNDS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>MAX_ROUNDS</code> 是必须设的熔断：没有轮次上限的补件流程会变成无限往返，商家的提交质量永远差一点，而系统既不拒绝也不通过，审批队列无限增长。达到轮次上限后应升级人工而不是继续自动往返。</p>\n<p><code>expired</code> 可 <code>reopen</code> 但需人工批准，这个设计区分了&quot;商家超时&quot;与&quot;商家放弃&quot;：前者可能是通知渠道问题，后者应当拒绝。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等与并发\">幂等与并发</h3><p>商家可能在多端同时提交补件材料，网络重试也可能造成重复提交。补件请求必须以 <code>(case_ref, requirement_id, round)</code> 为幂等键，并且<strong>同一轮内只有最后一次提交生效</strong>——不是先到先得，因为先到的那次常常是误操作或残缺上传。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE kyb_case (&#10;  case_ref        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  legal_entity_key TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  score_model     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  risk_score      NUMERIC(5,4),&#10;  risk_band       TEXT CHECK (risk_band IN (&#39;low&#39;,&#39;medium&#39;,&#39;high&#39;)),&#10;  hard_blocks     JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;[]&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  status          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;screening&#39;,&#10;                  -- &#39;screening&#39;|&#39;scoring&#39;|&#39;awaiting_docs&#39;|&#39;manual_review&#39;|&#39;approved&#39;|&#39;rejected&#39;&#10;  round_no        INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  decided_by      TEXT,&#10;  decided_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE document_request (&#10;  request_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_ref     TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES kyb_case(case_ref),&#10;  requirement_id TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  round_no     INT NOT NULL,&#10;  state        TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;created&#39;,&#10;  due_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  payload      JSONB,&#10;  created_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX ON document_request (case_ref, requirement_id, round_no);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kyb_case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_ref        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score_model     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  risk_score      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  risk_band       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (risk_band </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark